  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Amphicyon longiramus reconstructed from a skull and separate limb specimens, not one measured individual. Its robust body and tail are species-informed interpretations; coat, ears, muzzle padding, colour, posture and adult size are illustrative, with no mass or proven locomotion claim.",
    "zh": "犬熊 Amphicyon longiramus 参考颅骨与不同个体的肢骨复原，并非某个实测个体。粗壮躯体与尾部为结合物种资料的解释；毛被、耳、吻部软组织、颜色、姿态及成年尺寸均为示意，不作体重或已证实运动方式的判断。"
  },
